# B-private

Written unlock 2026-08-18: private channels allowed. Ladder is testnet/demo
first, live orders only after testnet evidence and an explicit user phrase.

- Own code: `app/bot/private/**`. Do not put keys or send in `app/screaner_b_o.py`.
- Do not turn `stub_broker.py` into a live sender.
- Paths: `/data/bbot/private/`, `/var/log/spread/bbot-private.log`, secrets
  outside git (`/etc/spread/bbot-private.env`, mode 600).
- Never write `/data/live`, `/data/bars`, `/data/compacted`, or D backup prefixes.
- Testnet process must not load live keys. Default `VENUE=testnet`, live send
  requires `VENUE=live` and `LIVE_ORDERS=1`.
- Live risk cap ≈ 100 USD per exchange (OKX and Bybit). First live order is
  minimum lot, `K_live=1`.
- Host Ops agent is not created on testnet; it opens at the first live order.
- No profitability claims. No secrets in git, chat, or logs.
